# Code of Conduct

## Our Commitment

LegalPath is committed to providing a welcoming, respectful, and inclusive environment for everyone.

We encourage collaboration regardless of experience level, nationality, gender, language, or professional background.

## Expected Behavior

* Be respectful.
* Be constructive.
* Assume good intentions.
* Welcome new contributors.
* Focus on improving the project.

## Unacceptable Behavior

* Harassment or discrimination
* Personal attacks
* Hate speech
* Trolling or disruptive behavior
* Publishing private information without permission

## Enforcement

Project maintainers reserve the right to remove comments, reject contributions, or restrict participation when behavior violates this Code of Conduct.

## Scope

This Code of Conduct applies to:

* GitHub Issues
* Pull Requests
* Discussions
* Project communication channels

By participating, you agree to follow these guidelines and help maintain a positive and collaborative community.
